You quickly move up to [1, 2, 3, 3, 3 (TL1-5)] tiles to arrive adjacent to a target location you can see, leaping around or over anyone in your way.  During your movement, you attack all foes within one grid of your path with both weapons for [82%, 91%, 98%, 104%, 110% (TL1-5)] weapon damage, causing those struck to bleed for 50% of the damage dealt over 5 turns.
